@startuml NovaMarket_OrderSaga_Sequence

title Sequence Diagram: NovaMarket Order Saga (Success & Error Scenarios)

participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Orders Service" as Orders
participant "Cart Service" as Cart
participant "Event Bus" as Bus
participant "Inventory Service" as Inventory
participant "Payment Service" as Payment
participant "Delivery Service" as Delivery
participant "Notification Service" as Notification
participant "Users Service" as Users

== Order Creation (Sync Start) ==
App -> Gateway: POST /orders (cart_id + delivery_address)
activate Gateway
Gateway -> Orders: Create draft order
activate Orders
Orders -> Cart: Fetch cart items (gRPC)
activate Cart
Cart --> Orders: Cart data
deactivate Cart

Orders -> Bus: Publish: OrderCreated (domain)
activate Bus
Bus --> Orders: (async ack)
deactivate Bus

== Reservation & Payment (Async) ==
Bus -> Inventory: Consume: ReservationRequested
activate Inventory
Inventory -> Bus: Publish: ReservationSucceeded
deactivate Inventory

Bus -> Payment: Consume: PaymentRequested
activate Payment
Payment --> Orders: Generate payment link
deactivate Payment

== Payment Flow ==
alt Payment Succeeded
    App -> Payment: User pays (redirect)
    activate Payment
    Payment -> Orders: Webhook: PaymentSucceeded
    deactivate Payment

    Orders -> Bus: Publish: DeliveryRequested
    activate Bus

    Bus -> Delivery: Consume: DeliveryRequested
    activate Delivery
    Delivery -> Bus: Publish: DeliverySucceeded
    deactivate Delivery

    Bus -> Notification: Consume: OrderStatusUpdated
    activate Notification
    Notification --> App: Push: "Order shipped"
    deactivate Notification

    Bus -> Users: Update profile history
    activate Users
    Users --> Orders: Ack
    deactivate Users

    Bus --> Orders: All done
    deactivate Bus

    Orders --> Gateway: 200 Success
    deactivate Orders
    Gateway --> App: 200 OK
    deactivate Gateway

else Payment Timeout (10 min)
    note over Orders: TTL: Payment timeout
    Orders -> Bus: Publish: PaymentTimeout
    activate Bus

    Bus -> Inventory: ReservationReleased (compensation)
    Bus -> Payment: RefundIssued
    Bus -> Notification: Notify: "Order cancelled"

    Bus --> Orders: Cancelled
    deactivate Bus

    Orders --> Gateway: 400 Timeout
    deactivate Orders
    Gateway --> App: 400 Cancelled
    deactivate Gateway
end

== User Cancellation ==
opt User Cancels Order
    App -> Gateway: POST
    activate Gateway
    Gateway -> Orders: UserCancelledOrder
    activate Orders

    Orders -> Bus: Trigger compensation
    activate Bus
    Bus -> Inventory: ReservationReleased
    Bus -> Payment: RefundIssued
    Bus -> Notification: Notify: "Order cancelled"
    Bus --> Orders: Done
    deactivate Bus

    Orders --> Gateway: 200 Cancelled
    deactivate Orders
    Gateway --> App: 200 OK
    deactivate Gateway
end

@enduml